@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}

<div class="container">
    <div class="card shadow p-5">
        <div class="privacy-container">

            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

            <p class="effective-date">
                <strong>Effective Date:</strong> 25 August 2026
            </p>

            <p>
                ITU Asau College is committed to protecting the privacy of our
                students, parents, guardians, staff, and website visitors.
                This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and
                protect personal information when you use our website and services.
            </p>

            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

            <p>We may collect the following types of information:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Full name, date of birth, address, phone number and email address.</li>
                <li>Student enrolment information.</li>
                <li>Parent or guardian contact details.</li>
                <li>Academic records and course information.</li>
                <li>Emergency contact information.</li>
                <li>Information submitted through online forms and enquiries.</li>
                <li>Technical information such as browser type and website usage data.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>

            <p>The information we collect may be used to:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Process student enrolment applications.</li>
                <li>Maintain accurate student records.</li>
                <li>Communicate with students, parents and guardians.</li>
                <li>Provide educational services and support.</li>
                <li>Respond to enquiries and requests.</li>
                <li>Improve our website and online services.</li>
                <li>Meet legal and regulatory requirements.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Protection of Your Information</h2>

            <p>
                ITU Asau College takes reasonable administrative, technical and
                physical measures to protect personal information from
                unauthorised access, alteration, disclosure or destruction.
            </p>

            <p>
                Access to personal information is limited to authorised staff
                members who require the information to perform their duties.
            </p>

            <h2>Sharing Your Information</h2>

            <p>
                ITU Asau College does not sell or rent personal information.
                Information may only be shared when necessary or legally required,
                including:
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>When required by New Zealand law.</li>
                <li>With authorised government or educational authorities.</li>
                <li>
                    With trusted service providers who help operate our website
                    or school systems.
                </li>
                <li>When necessary to protect the safety and wellbeing of students or staff.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Cookies and Website Analytics</h2>

            <p>
                Our website may use cookies to improve your browsing experience
                and help us understand how visitors use the website. You can
                manage or disable cookies through your browser settings.
            </p>

            <h2>Student Records</h2>

            <p>
                Student records are confidential and are only accessible by
                authorised staff members. Student information is maintained in
                accordance with applicable New Zealand privacy and education
                requirements.
            </p>

            <h2>Your Rights</h2>

            <p>You may have the right to:</p>

            <ul>
                <li>Request access to your personal information.</li>
                <li>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information.</li>
                <li>Ask how your information is collected and used.</li>
                <li>Request that your information be updated where appropriate.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>

            <p>
                Our website may contain links to external websites. ITU Asau
                College is not responsible for the privacy practices or content
                of external websites.
            </p>

            <h2>Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>

            <p>
                This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time to reflect
                changes in legal requirements or school practices. Any updates
                will be published on this page with a revised effective date.
            </p>

            <h2>Contact Us</h2>

            <p>
                If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or how your
                personal information is handled, please contact ITU Asau College.
            </p>

            <div class="privacy-contact">
                <strong>ITU Asau College</strong><br />
                Email: info@ituasaucollege.edu.ws<br />
                Phone: +685 7736778<br />
                Address: Fa'ananu Road, Matavai, Vaisigano, Savaii, Samoa
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</div>
